来源: immortalwrt/immortalwrt package/kernel/r8101/patches/002-Makefile-fix-CFLAGS-with-linux-6.15.patch
(飞牛的 r8101.ko 带有该补丁的行为, 见笔记 step14-extmod-net.md)

